#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:leaders_marketplace.res_config_settings_view_form_marketplace
msgid "Off when the marketplace has no warehouse of its own: vendors then ship their own goods (FBM only) and FBL is hidden and refused everywhere. Cannot be turned off while active FBL offers or FBL stock exist."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_only_presentation
msgid "Off: a checkout made only of vendor products is shown as today. On: it is kept out of the customer's Orders list (it lives under Marketplace Orders), the confirmation page shows the checkout total instead of an empty summary, and the customer receives a Marketplace order confirmation email listing the vendor orders."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_product_questions_moderation
msgid "Off: an answered question is public straight away (reviewers can still hide it). On: an answer also needs a reviewer's approval before it is shown."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_customer_can_cancel_orders
msgid "Off: customers cannot cancel. On: a customer can cancel a whole checkout or one seller's part from the order page, with a reason, while nothing in it has shipped. Online payments get a draft refund for finance to post."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_catalog_offers_enabled
msgid "Off: every portal product is a new product and the product page shows no seller. On: vendors can sell an existing product, the product page shows the seller and other offers, /seller/<slug> storefronts open, and customers can rate completed orders."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_product_questions_enabled
msgid "Off: no question section on product pages, no vendor Questions page. On: logged-in customers ask questions on the product page and sellers with an active offer on the product answer them from the vendor portal. A question is public once answered."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_can_cancel_orders
msgid "Off: only the back-office cancels vendor orders. On: a vendor owner can cancel an order from the portal, with a reason, until it ships. The customer's payment is reversed and a refund is prepared."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_shipping_providers_enabled
msgid "Off: shipping providers are ignored (vendors type the tracking number, the carrier webhook answers 404). On: vendors can create shipments and labels with the active providers and carriers can report status through /api/v1/shipping/webhook/<provider code>."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_unified_customer_orders
msgid "Off: the customer's My orders card opens the list of vendor orders, as before. On: it opens one list with a row per checkout (company and marketplace parts), an order page grouped by seller with timelines, invoices and actions, and Buy again."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_bulk_import_enabled
msgid "Off: the portal page /my/vendor/import does not exist. On: vendors can upload xlsx/csv files to create products, offers on catalog products, or update price, stock and discount by seller SKU."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_returns_center_enabled
msgid "Off: the return form and the customer's returns page are as before. On: the return form asks for a reason code, photos, refund or exchange and a pickup date (warehouse goods); the returns page shows the next step and deadline of every return and dispute and each return has a detail page."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_api_write_enabled
msgid "Off: the vendor API keys page and the /api/v1/vendor endpoints that use a marketplace key do not exist (404). On: vendor owners can create API keys and use the API to manage offers, ship orders, answer returns and read wallet and settlements."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_variants_enabled
msgid "Off: the vendor product form is the single-variant form. On: vendors can pick existing attributes to make variants (one offer per variant), add extra images and write specifications, on products they own."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_enforce_returns_reserve
msgid "Off: the vendor tier's reserve percentage is recorded but the vendor is paid the full earning, as the marketplace has always worked. On: the reserve is actually withheld from the wallet and paid back once the return window closes with no open return."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_apply_enabled
msgid "Off: vendor applications are created by staff only. On: anyone can apply at /vendor/apply and follow their application by email link."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_vendor_discounts_enabled
msgid "Off: vendors cannot set discounts (portal, bulk import and API refuse); discounts already stored keep running. On: a vendor can discount an offer by percentage or sale price, with optional start and end dates. The vendor funds the discount; the website shows the original price struck through."
msgstr ""

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_allow_vendor_attributes
msgid "Off: vendors only choose existing attributes and values. On: they may also add new values (and new attributes), which become visible to every vendor."
msgstr ""

